beats_online.npz: the weights of the 8 online beat-tracking LSTMs (BEATS_LSTM) and the matching filterbank
from madmom (https://github.com/CPJKU/madmom), converted to a plain NumPy archive for Lume's beattrack.py.

Model: Sebastian Böck, Florian Krebs and Gerhard Widmer, "A Multi-Model Approach to Beat Tracking
Considering Heterogeneous Music Styles" (ISMIR 2014) and "Accurate Tempo Estimation based on Recurrent
Neural Networks and Resonating Comb Filters" (ISMIR 2015); beat tracking HMM by Florian Krebs, Sebastian
Böck and Gerhard Widmer, "An Efficient State Space Model for Joint Tempo and Meter Tracking" (ISMIR 2015).

